EVALUATION.md §9.3, §13; CLI.md §3.7: an amended value's provenance is its right-hand side
with its layer, and History goes back through each layer that set it to the base: a default
amended by two layers, a JSON value, a record amended then amended inside, a derived default
re-evaluated, an added entry and an added map key, which replaced nothing but carry their layer
(review call c); the chain goes on through an ancestor a later layer replaced whole (call d).
